# ** 5. Larger counts are scaled down to fit the width.
$ hledger -f - activity --postings -0 -w 30
Posting counts in 2022-W52:

W52  30  █████████████████████

<
2023-01-01
  (a)  1
  (b)  1
  (b)  1

# ** 6. -S/--sort-amount shows the accounts with most postings first.
$ hledger -f - activity --postings -S -w 40
Posting counts in 2022-W52:

▒ b  ▓ a

W52  3  ▒▒▓

# ** 7. In SVG, the total isn't marked, since it would be just the top of each stack.
$ hledger -f - activity --postings -O svg | grep -c 'class="mark'
0
>=1

